# Minimal source release: track LaTeX manuscript sources, their figures,
# and the Python code. Ignore everything else.
# Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...but still descend into subdirectories...
!*/
# ...and keep these source types:
!*.tex
!*.bib
!*.py
!.gitignore
# ...plus the top-level project README:
!/README.md
# ...plus the manuscript figures (they accompany the LaTeX):
!paper/figures/*.pdf
!paper/figures/*.png
# ...plus the compiled manuscript PDF:
!paper/main.pdf
# ...plus the verified result CSVs (this repository is the reproducibility archive):
!results/*.csv
# The stale supplementary document is dropped: the repository + archived release
# replaces it, so supplement.tex/pdf are not part of the published record.
paper/supplement.tex

# (Everything else stays local: docs, working notes and PDFs, build
#  intermediates, and caches.)
